==Trivia==
*"Argo" means ''I start (with)'' in the old Greek language.
*Some people believe that Argo is a tribute to the character [[Wikipedia:Ka_D'Argo|D'Argo]] from the science fiction series [[Wikipedia:Farscape|Farscape]] (where his race is called Luxan). 
*Latin Argo from Greek Άργώ, the mythical ship of the Argonauts
*His henchman skills were updated in the [[Game updates/20091022|22nd October 2009 update]].
**This added [[Lava Arrows]] and [[Smoldering Embers]], and removed [[Bed of Coals]] from his skills. 

